    "sections": [
      {
        "kind": "definition",
        "summary": "",
        "status": "documented",
        "claims": [
          {
            "text": "Audience suggestions are optional settings in the upgraded Smart+ experience that advertisers can choose to help guide automatic targeting.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "tiktok.smart_plus.targeting",
                "source_url": "https://ads.tiktok.com/resources/help/article/about-targeting-for-your-upgraded-smart-experience",
                "locator": "You can also set up Audience suggestions, where you can choose additional audience settings to help guide automatic targeting.",
                "source_site": "TikTok Ads Help Center",
                "source_title": "Upgraded Smart+ targeting",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Suggested audience settings include Age (25-55+), Gender, Include Audience, and Interest & Behaviors, and audience expansion is applied (YES) for this option.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "tiktok.smart_plus.targeting",
                "source_url": "https://ads.tiktok.com/resources/help/article/about-targeting-for-your-upgraded-smart-experience",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "TikTok Ads Help Center",
                "source_title": "Upgraded Smart+ targeting",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "summary": "",
        "status": "documented",
        "claims": [
          {
            "text": "By default, Smart+ uses automatic targeting to identify and optimize toward the best-performing audience with minimal input from the advertiser; suggestions are one of two optional overlays alongside audience controls.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "tiktok.smart_plus.targeting",
                "source_url": "https://ads.tiktok.com/resources/help/article/about-targeting-for-your-upgraded-smart-experience",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "TikTok Ads Help Center",
                "source_title": "Upgraded Smart+ targeting",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Audience suggestions act as guidance signals to automatic targeting rather than hard constraints, because audience expansion is applied for this option (unlike audience controls).",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "tiktok.smart_plus.targeting",
                "source_url": "https://ads.tiktok.com/resources/help/article/about-targeting-for-your-upgraded-smart-experience",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "TikTok Ads Help Center",
                "source_title": "Upgraded Smart+ targeting",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Switching to custom targeting offers a fuller range of manual options, but the documentation notes this may limit delivery and impact campaign performance.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "tiktok.smart_plus.targeting",
                "source_url": "https://ads.tiktok.com/resources/help/article/about-targeting-for-your-upgraded-smart-experience",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "TikTok Ads Help Center",
                "source_title": "Upgraded Smart+ targeting",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "use_cases",
        "summary": "",
        "status": "documented",
        "claims": [
          {
            "text": "Use it when you want to keep Smart+ automatic targeting while nudging who the campaign can reach with baseline settings such as age, gender, included audiences, and interests & behaviors.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "tiktok.smart_plus.targeting",
                "source_url": "https://ads.tiktok.com/resources/help/article/about-targeting-for-your-upgraded-smart-experience",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "TikTok Ads Help Center",
                "source_title": "Upgraded Smart+ targeting",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Do not rely on it when you need hard exclusion or precise control over who sees your ads — that calls for audience controls or switching to custom targeting.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "tiktok.smart_plus.targeting",
                "source_url": "https://ads.tiktok.com/resources/help/article/about-targeting-for-your-upgraded-smart-experience",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "TikTok Ads Help Center",
                "source_title": "Upgraded Smart+ targeting",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Suggestions suit advertisers who want to steer the learning system lightly without taking over delivery; since expansion is applied, the system may reach beyond the suggested settings, so this option fits broad-reach goals more than tightly filtered ones.",
            "status": "inferred",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "tiktok.smart_plus.targeting",
                "source_url": "https://ads.tiktok.com/resources/help/article/about-targeting-for-your-upgraded-smart-experience",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "TikTok Ads Help Center",
                "source_title": "Upgraded Smart+ targeting",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          }
        ]
      },
