          {
            "text": "In the Audience targeting module, choose the targeting strategy — deciding between audience controls, audience suggestions, or manual targeting.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "tiktok.smart_plus.targeting",
                "source_url": "https://ads.tiktok.com/resources/help/article/about-targeting-for-your-upgraded-smart-experience",
